        "(6) 在实践中都应用哪些功率的单位？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**练习 67**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(1) 将一盏电灯接入 127 伏特的电源电路中. 如果灯泡中的电流",
        "强度为 0.60 安培，试求灯泡的电功率."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(2) 电炉的规定电压是 220 伏特，规定电流强度是 3.0 安培. 试求",
        "电炉的电功率."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**146. 用电功率表示电功**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在各种用电器的说明书中，就象在电灯、电炉、电动机等",
        "上面一样，都标明用电器的电功率. 利用公式 $P=\\frac{A}{t}$，就可以",
        "根据电功率计算出在一段时间 $t$ 内的电功. 由这个公式可导",
        "出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$A=Pt$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "以瓦特为单位表示电功率，以秒为单位表示时间，则所得",
        "的功的单位为焦耳："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**$1$ 瓦特$=\\frac{1\\text{ 焦耳}}{1\\text{ 秒}}$，所以 $1$ 焦耳$=1$ 瓦特$\\times1$ 秒.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在实践中为了计算上的方便，通常不用焦耳做单位来表",
        "示电功，而是使用其它的单位："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**$1$ 瓦特小时$=3600$ 焦耳；**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
